KEDR's command-line behavior and original report layout derive from a clean-room
Go reimplementation of Robusta KRR (https://github.com/robusta-dev/krr), based on
KRR commit d1ccf01 and used under the MIT License.

Resource recommendation calculations now use github.com/kedify/recommender;
KEDR no longer promises KRR-compatible recommendation semantics. That dependency
is governed by its own LICENSE and PUBLIC_SOURCE_LICENSE.

KEDR is not Robusta SaaS and does not include Robusta's web UI, HolmesGPT,
publishing integrations, enforcer, or Helm chart.

The calculating-title shimmer in internal/ui/shimmer.go is adapted from
github.com/handleui/shimmer, commit 27767358e0b0, Copyright (c) 2025 @handleui.

